{
  "schema": "verse.ui.keys/1",
  "note": "Bindable actions and default keys (WP18.8). Key names are Unreal FKey names. Actions with a \"ui\" field are handled by VerseUI; the rest are gameplay input, published as the Verse.Settings.Key.<action> console variables. The return key is app-backed (welcome.settings.return_key).",
